  loreMessages:
  - Level: 0
    Message: 'Maintenance report #52


      The AC unit on the roof should be replaced.
      I managed to patch it up for now, but it won''t hold up for long. If I get
      called here one more time management can suffocate for all I care.


      -
      J.G.

'
  - Level: 1
    Message: "Fwd: Project funds\n\LThe boys at purchasing are wondering if we\u2019re
      cleared for that additional funding for Project Molar? They want to get the
      orders sorted by Friday, so please confirm the status of allocated funds with
      Richardson at your earliest convenience.\n\L- Lester"
  - Level: 1
    Message: "Re: Re: Costs\_\n\LCFO wants to know about the procurement costs of
      the Material.\nCould you send the relevant sheets to statistics? Also, let\u2019s
      have\nlegal prepped and ready for any potential leaks.\n\L- Paterson"
  - Level: 1
    Message: "Strategy pivot\n\LIt\u2019s official, the board has officially greenlit
      the proposal. It\u2019s enough to keep our heads above water, but let\u2019s
      make sure the team is on the same page so that we focus on mission-critical
      stuff only. Keep the red tape to a minimum, but make sure they continue to
      understand how far up the good old NDA boot is in their ass, got it?\n\L- Voss"
  - Level: 2
    Message: "Maintenance report #46\L\LWhen prospecting for reno, there was evidence
      of some parts of the wall being hollow on each floor. No sign of this in the
      blueprints, but should be confirmed before the construction starts.\n\L- J.G."
  - Level: 2
    Message: "Your cut\n\LI stashed your cut in the toilet. I admit it's hella nasty
      but at least we can be sure nobody's gonna be snooping around in there.\n\L-
      J"
  - Level: 2
    Message: "Re: Leads on Buyers\n\LWe\u2019ve got a tip from John in Accounting
      that the folks at EngiCo had heard some good stuff about the new product. Might
      be worth setting up a meeting. Check in with Hobb on how you\u2019d like to
      proceed.\n\L- Colt"
